    kind: invariant  # f313
    title: "Kind-blind candidate selection credits a Go method call to a same-package function row: 9 entries mis-credited, and tr.Do on an http.Transport is reported as a net_send boundary that does not exist"  # f313
    status: violated  # f313
    priority: 2  # f313
    parent:  # f313
    tags:  # f313
    - go  # f313
    - io_boundary  # f313
